<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wednesday's spot</p>
<p>rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.05		 41.10</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	66.95		 67.05</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.85		 23.90</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.324		 0.326</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   10.92		 10.94</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.17		 11.19</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.07		  1.09</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.15 pct	    2.35 pct</p>
</text>
